      "content": "Genetic Testing and Counseling"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "w3u5kwj",
      "content": "Genetic testing identifies inherited disorders, while genetic counseling helps families understand genetic risks and make informed health decisions."
    },
